  "LV_003045_0030_CER": "[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]……[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]は……",
  "LV_003915_0000_NAR": "セレッサは、[RUBY:BASE ]涙[RUBY:BEGIN ]なみだ[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]必死[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひっし[RUBY:END ]でこらえ、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]自分[RUBY:BEGIN ]じぶん[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]背中[RUBY:BEGIN ]せなか[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]押[RUBY:BEGIN ]お[RUBY:END ]すように、[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]へ[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]へと[RUBY:BASE ]進[RUBY:BEGIN ]すす[RUBY:END ]んでいました。",
