  "BK_3030_0050_NAR": "[RUBY:BASE ]一歩[RUBY:BEGIN ]いっぽ[RUBY:END ]、また[RUBY:BASE ]一歩[RUBY:BEGIN ]いっぽ[RUBY:END ]と、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]怪物[RUBY:BEGIN ]かいぶつ[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]追[RUBY:BEGIN ]お[RUBY:END ]い[RUBY:BASE ]詰[RUBY:BEGIN ]つ[RUBY:END ]められるチェシャ。",
  "BK_8110_0030_CER": "「あんたをお[RUBY:BASE ]家[RUBY:BEGIN ]うち[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]帰[RUBY:BEGIN ]かえ[RUBY:END ]してあげられる[RUBY:BASE ]力[RUBY:BEGIN ]ちから[RUBY:END ]じゃ\r\nないかもしれないけど……\r\nきっと[RUBY:BASE ]何[RUBY:BEGIN ]なに[RUBY:END ]かの[RUBY:BASE ]役[RUBY:BEGIN ]やく[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]立[RUBY:BEGIN ]た[RUBY:END ]つはずよ」",
