  "LV_003915_0010_NAR": "[RUBY:BASE ]泣[RUBY:BEGIN ]な[RUBY:END ]いたら、また[RUBY:BASE ]弱[RUBY:BEGIN ]よわ[RUBY:END ]い[RUBY:BASE ]自分[RUBY:BEGIN ]じぶん[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]戻[RUBY:BEGIN ]もど[RUBY:END ]ってしまう。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]は[RUBY:BASE ]強[RUBY:BEGIN ]つよ[RUBY:END ]くなる！　……そう[RUBY:BASE ]自分[RUBY:BEGIN ]じぶん[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]言[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]い[RUBY:BASE ]聞[RUBY:BEGIN ]き[RUBY:END ]かせていました。",
