  "LV_003035_0000_NAR": "『[RUBY:BASE ]次[RUBY:BEGIN ]つぎ[RUBY:END ]のエレメント・コアを[RUBY:BASE ]探[RUBY:BEGIN ]さが[RUBY:END ]すんだろう、\r\nさっさと[RUBY:BASE ]行[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]け！』",
